                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A Medium or larger starship is within 0 zones of the hazard</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The hazard appears in a 5-foot square adjacent to an exterior (hull) wall inside a room on board the starship (determined randomly or by the GM). The hazard then rolls initiative.</p>"
