            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Proliferate Slime",
            "sort": 0,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Inching forward on prehensile tendrils, the hazard covers the ceiling, floor, and walls of a room with acidic slime. The hazard expands its slime to three adjacent 5-foot cubes. The affected area becomes difficult terrain. Battle stations become malfunctioning when they're covered in slime due to Proliferate Slime. The hazard can Proliferate Slime through doors, bulkheads, hulls, and other features of a starship.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
