        "details": {
            "description": "<p>An unwelcome infestation pollutes the decks with sticky slime that proliferates throughout a starship.</p>",
            "disable": "<p>@Check[nature|dc:18] (trained) or Survival (trained) to denature the hazard with chemicals (destroys a @Template[type:cone|distance:5] of slime on a success, or @Template[type:cone|distance:10] on a critical success), or @Check[religion|dc:25] (expert; magic conduit) to purify the starship; two successes are required to disable the hazard, or destroy every infested square</p>",
            "isComplex": true,
            "level": {
                "value": 4
            },
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Starfinder Tech Core"
            },
            "reset": "<p>The slime returns and begins proliferating again in 24 hours unless the entire starship is completely cleansed, or the starship is restored to full Hull Points.</p>",
            "routine": "<p>(2 actions) The hazard uses Proliferate Slime each round, spreading to as many rooms as possible until the starship interior is covered or the hazard is destroyed. The hazard then uses Spew Corrosive Vapor.</p>"
